               Table "public.orders"
 Column  |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default 
---------+---------+-----------+----------+---------
 id      | text    |           | not null | 
 address | jsonb   |           |          | 
 buyer   | text    |           |          | 
 oid     | integer |           |          | 
 pid     | integer |           |          | 
 placed  | date    |           |          | 
 tags    | text[]  |           |          | 
 total   | numeric |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "orders_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (id)
    "orders_oid_key" UNIQUE CONSTRAINT, btree (oid)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "orders_buyer_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (buyer) REFERENCES person(id)

